      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Winnougan's 10 Toes V1.3\n\n## **You can download all the models from the links below.**\n\n---\n## 👉 **[Winnougan/Krea-2-Base-Turbo-NVFP4-FP8-INT8](https://huggingface.co/Winnougan/Krea-2-Base-Turbo-NVFP4-FP8-INT8)**\n\n## 👉 **[Krea 2 Raw Turbo LoRA](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Krea-2/resolve/main/loras/krea2_turbo_lora_rank_64_bf16.safetensors)**\n\n---\n\n## Required Downloads\n\n## **Text Encoder Uncensored** — Comfy now supports INT8 Convrot text encoders! Load with CLIPLoader, type `krea2`:  \n## 👉 [qwen3vl_4b_uncensored_INT8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Winnougan/Krea-2-Base-Turbo-NVFP4-FP8-INT8/resolve/main/Text%20Encoder/qwen3vl_4b_uncensored_int8_convrot.safetensors)\n\n## **VAE** — Qwen Image:  \n## 👉 [qwen_image_vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Krea-2/resolve/main/vae/qwen_image_vae.safetensors)\n\n---\n\n## Recommended Settings\n\n| Model | Steps | CFG | Resolution |\n|-------|-------|-----|------------|\n| Turbo | 8 | 0.0 | 1024–2048px |\n| Raw | 52 | 3.5 | up to 1024px |"
      ],
      "color": "#432",
